      {
        "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.CfgDialogGroup, Assembly-CSharp",
        "desc": null,
        "textMaxIndex": 0,
        "textGroupId": "10000007008_2",
        "useFixedDialogGroup": false,
        "fixedDialogGroupId": 0,
        "dialogs": {
          "$type": "System.Collections.Generic.List`1[[miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp]], mscorlib",
          "$values": [
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715573668_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A挠头}说起来其实有点不好意思——\n最近外出探险的时候总会想到我的家乡，\n一个有着全星海最美的落日的地方。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715573668_content",
                "value": "{A挠头}说起来其实有点不好意思——\n最近外出探险的时候总会想到我的家乡，\n一个有着全星海最美的落日的地方。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715573668
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715573669_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "这几年我走过了上千条探险路线，\n从荒漠到雨林再到雪山，\n都没有看到比家乡的草原更好看的落日。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715573669_content",
                "value": "这几年我走过了上千条探险路线，\n从荒漠到雨林再到雪山，\n都没有看到比家乡的草原更好看的落日。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715573669
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078304_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "{A笑哈哈}以前在家的时候，\n到了日落时分……\n就是我和弟弟的捕猎时间。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078304_content",
                "value": "{A笑哈哈}以前在家的时候，\n到了日落时分……\n就是我和弟弟的捕猎时间。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078304
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078305_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "弓下身，瞄准猎物调整呼吸然后——\n{A加油打气}出手！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078305_content",
                "value": "弓下身，瞄准猎物调整呼吸然后——\n{A加油打气}出手！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078305
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078306_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "又或者是，{A想象}利落甩竿、耐心等待，\n再……同水里的鱼来一场角力，\n让它乖乖接受变成烤鱼的命运。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078306_content",
                "value": "又或者是，{A想象}利落甩竿、耐心等待，\n再……同水里的鱼来一场角力，\n让它乖乖接受变成烤鱼的命运。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078306
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078307_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "要是刚好有成群的风滚草来，\n我们还会叫上伙伴一起比赛——\n{A挑衅坏笑}谁追到的风滚草更大谁就，只负责吃！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078307_content",
                "value": "要是刚好有成群的风滚草来，\n我们还会叫上伙伴一起比赛——\n{A挑衅坏笑}谁追到的风滚草更大谁就，只负责吃！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078307
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078308_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "总之，\n{A点头}在我的记忆里，\n家乡的落日代表了最美好的时刻。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078308_content",
                "value": "总之，\n{A点头}在我的记忆里，\n家乡的落日代表了最美好的时刻。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078308
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078309_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "所以我在想……\n{A笑哈哈}把那样的景象搬到领地里，\n就能和现在的新朋友们一起分享美好了！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078309_content",
                "value": "所以我在想……\n{A笑哈哈}把那样的景象搬到领地里，\n就能和现在的新朋友们一起分享美好了！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3715078309
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078310_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "要是再扎个小营地——\n生一堆随时能烤鱼的篝火……\n就太完美了，库拉巴塔！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_11010137008_3715078310_content",
                "value": "要是再扎个小营地——\n生一堆随时能烤鱼的篝火……\n就太完美了，库拉巴塔！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
